DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20260904T130000
SUMMARY:Lloyd's: LCR — Phase 1 syndicates to submit the final Lloyd's C
 apital Return (LCR) ba
DESCRIPTION:LCR - Phase 1 syndicates to submit the final Lloyd's Capital 
 Return (LCR) based on the latest Syndicate Business Forecast (SBF) submi
 ssion.  Submit via the Market Data Collection (MDC) platform by 1pm.\n\
 nPlease attach all accompanying documentation as specified in the LCR gu
 idance\, as well as Major Model Change (MMC) applications where required
  and where possible the validation report.  If uploading documentation 
 after this submission date please use SecureShare (Lloyds.com>ToolsandSy
 stems>SecureShare>MRC - Syndicate Capital Setting).\n\n▸ WHY IT MATTER
 S (Submission Markets): The big one. The SBF is each syndicate's busines
 s plan for the next year of account - it drives capital\, stamp capacity
  and Lloyd's oversight categorisation. Our SBF season preview: https://o
 pmodal.com/articles/sbf-season\n\nApplies to: Managing Agents\n\nOfficia
 l entry: https://www.lloyds.com/market-resources/business-timetable
URL:https://www.lloyds.com/market-resources/business-timetable
CATEGORIES:LCR
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Lloyd’s deadline tomorrow: LCR
TRIGGER:-P1D
END:VALARM
